msgstr "如果在OAuth提供者設定中進行了配置，則在創建帳戶時顯示社交登錄按鈕（Google、Apple、Microsoft）。"

#: models.py:472
msgid "Live - Deliver emails normally"
msgstr "正常發送郵件"

#: models.py:473
msgid "Paused - Hold emails for later delivery"
msgstr "暫停 - 保留郵件以待後續發送"

#: models.py:474
msgid "Log Only - Record emails but never deliver"
msgstr "僅記錄 - 記錄郵件但永不發送"

#: models.py:481 templates/admin/core/sitesettings/change_form.html:389
msgid "Email Delivery Mode"
msgstr "電子郵件傳送模式"

#: models.py:483
msgid ""
"Controls how outgoing emails are handled. 'Live' delivers normally. 'Paused'"
" holds emails until you switch back to Live. 'Log Only' records emails in "
"the outbox for review but never sends them."
msgstr ""
"控制外發郵件的處理方式。'Live' 會正常發送郵件。'Paused' 會暫停郵件，直到您切換回 Live。'Log Only' "
"會在郵件出站匣中記錄郵件以供審查，但不會實際發送。"

#: models.py:492
msgid "Test Redirect Email"
msgstr "測試重定向郵件"

#: models.py:494
msgid ""
"When set, ALL outgoing emails are redirected to this address instead of the "
"real recipient. Useful for testing email templates and flows. Leave blank to"
" send to actual recipients."
msgstr "若設置此選項，所有外發郵件都會轉發到此地址，而不是實際收件人。此功能可用於測試郵件模板和流程。若要發送到實際收件人，請留空此欄。"

#: models.py:503
msgid "Sandbox Email Whitelist"
msgstr "沙盒郵件白名單"

#: models.py:505
msgid ""
"In sandbox mode, only emails to these addresses will be delivered. All other"
" emails are logged but never sent. The admin email is always included "
"automatically. Maximum 10 addresses."
msgstr "在沙盒模式下，僅會傳送至這些郵件地址的郵件。所有其他郵件都會被記錄但不會實際發送。管理員郵件會自動包含在內。最多可輸入 10 個地址。"

#: models.py:514
msgid "Sandbox SMS Whitelist"
msgstr "沙盒簡訊白名單"

#: models.py:516
msgid ""
"In sandbox mode, only SMS messages to these phone numbers will be sent. All "
"other messages are logged but never delivered. Use E.164 format (e.g., "
"+1234567890). Maximum 5 numbers."
msgstr ""
"在沙盒模式下，僅會傳送至這些電話號碼的簡訊。所有其他簡訊都會被記錄但不會實際發送。請使用 E.164 格式（例如：+1234567890）。最多可輸入 "
"5 個號碼。"

